{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107902","id":2612326079,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6btO6_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107902","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107902.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107902.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107902","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107902/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107902/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107902/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c78c3ba894ab3b80079a6249b35d047c6fd0a6c1","number":107902,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rewrite Radiance and Reflection probes to use Octahedral maps.","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Reimplements Sky Radiance and Reflection Probes by using Octahedral maps instead of Cubemaps. This drops the requirement of needing cubemap array support on the target platform.\r\n\r\nOctahedral maps have pretty big benefits over cubemaps when it comes to memory usage and sampling performance. It also leads to a heavy reduction in the amount of compute dispatches or render passes necessary to compute the mipmaps and the rough versions of the reflections.\r\n\r\nPerformance benefits are expected across the board for a very small difference in quality. I'll gather some comparisons while the PR is in progress.\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n- [x] Check if coefficients for roughness filters need to be recomputed or if they can be used as is.\r\n- [x] Fix Update Once behavior.\r\n- [x] Test for regressions.\r\n- [x] Gather some performance comparisons against `master`.\r\n- [x] Track error where shaders were never freed (CubeToOctmapShaderRD).\r\n- [x] [Investigate seam](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107902#pullrequestreview-2968178351).\r\n- [x] Investigate toon shader radiance error.\r\n- [x] Replicate border generation on raster version.\r\n- [x] Replicate border generation on fast filter version.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/per